  "description": "Experience premium living in this stunning 2 bed, fully furnished apartment in the highly sought after Vantage by Kennedy Wilson development. Located beside the Central Park LUAS stop, this home offers exceptional style, top quality finishes and unbeatable convenience.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Spacious 2 bedroom layout with master en suite\n• Professionally designed interiors, bespoke furnishings & floor to ceiling windows\n• Modern kitchen with integrated appliances and stone worktops\n• Luxury bathrooms with Italian sanitaryware & underfloor heating\n• Large private balconies, generous hallways & excellent storage\n\nExclusive Resident Amenities\n• State of the art gym and fitness studio\n• Stylish residents lounges & cookery demo kitchen\n• Dedicated workspace desks in quiet comfortable surroundings\n• Private cinema, games room, kids’ play area & landscaped gardens\n• On site management team, 24/7 emergency support & secure underground parking\n\nPrime Dublin 18 Location\n• LUAS at your door – 22 mins to Dublin city centre\n• Quick access to M50 & M11\n• On site cafés, restaurants, doctors surgery, dentist & crèche\n• Minutes from Stillorgan, Dundrum & Carrickmines shopping\nThis is a rare opportunity to rent a luxury home in one of Dublin’s iconic buildings in one of the best connected neighbourhoods.\n\nEarly viewing advised.",
